  user: anon     password: chimera
  root: root     password: chimera

  To install to disk: doas h77-installer

  Before running it, partition and format the target disk by hand
  (cfdisk/fdisk + mkfs), then mount it all under /mnt/root -- the
  root filesystem AT /mnt/root itself, everything else (e.g. an EFI
  system partition) under /mnt/root/<path>. On a UEFI machine the ESP
  must be a FAT32 partition; on BIOS/MBR none is needed. SystemRoot
  in the installer expects exactly /mnt/root.

